# Phase 3 du plan d'action — à appliquer après phases-0-a-2.patch.
#
# feat(backend): passenger search filters, seat layout and self-service account
# 
# - Departures: filter by origin, arrival, route, vehicle and driver;
#   "reservable" keeps open, non-full, not-yet-gone departures; free-text
#   search now matches city, cooperative and plate (I-B24)
# - Vehicle models carry their seat layout (migration 0029) so the app
#   draws the real cabin
# - PUT /users/me and POST /users/me/password (revokes every session)
# - PATCH /notifications/read-all
# - Logout works with the refresh token alone
# - Seed: routes served in both directions every day, per-model layouts
# - Tests for the passenger API
# 
# feat(mobile): passenger app - search, seat map, booking, tickets, profile
# 
# - Trip search by origin, arrival and date; departure detail with a seat
#   map drawn from the vehicle layout, one passenger form per seat,
#   conflict reload on 409
# - Reservations (pay at the counter, cancel), tickets with a QR code,
#   notifications with read-all, profile and password change
# - Driver: confirmation before check-in, passenger list with boarding state
# - Typed models and a single travel repository replace the untyped
#   services; French date and money formatting
# - Errors show the backend message; tokens and cached user in secure storage
# - Cleartext HTTP only in debug/profile builds
# - Widget and unit tests, run in CI
# 
